<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 1.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 1.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, April 1 on Friday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   01.04.97	  28.03.97     </p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.5330	 6.5112</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3870	 2.3768</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.6402	 4.6190</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2340	 3.2343</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5296	 0.5267</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.8041	 0.8015</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2983	 0.2971</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8794	 6.8841</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6978	 0.6985</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.3006	 1.2988</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
